07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7Um-5i7pLTcQ7kNvwHLYvCy&_nc_oc=AdpnyUTVvhDuzlwPXQj1ig9FbAYfg1XiS9aYmxHUOvM7Jk5aygH9wNqGGa3875lZ5gg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKXN5KHdromD4lbxU6gN9wIyJu_nHao7ZH5DiRaJhI3Hw&oe=6AAFEB42"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NGp3GYuiztwQ7kNvwGbP1Jn&_nc_oc=AdpaaAGyJmkqDrwi7XOx2Rsyz045ftivLsZky9dVFyjxAgBAHRXDwqxQZWymih5_LGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ3i3BakS7-Y2OPY6TL8wa27xuNnNROEvPbxcIt934iCQ&oe=6AAFE0BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1bOpA2yCdqsQ7kNvwHPRTHI&_nc_oc=Adq9-l8IRfAfM-IswYTRTjsI0x97h2OMwmZUoLRzTKiy5m4oMuYxAT6hgbEioYqTfiQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJK8vrBOq0fkJHa7SMqX8U4x0df4ftimnnAnHOWtxJUaA&oe=6AAFEFB0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic